{"id":"a7513012-f1a5-42e5-b339-651433ac627d","level":2,"callsign":"Pointe","name":"Marcia \"Marc\" Ridley","player_name":"","status":"ACTIVE","dead":false,"text_appearance":"","notes":"","history":"<p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\tMarcia “Marc” Ridley was born to a diasporan family in the backwater reaches of Union space.&nbsp;She grew up with limited opportunities, and joined up with her local constabulary at a young age.&nbsp;Over years of work her diligent personality brought her to a firearms unit where she continued to grow.</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\tDespite the strong skills in CQB tactics Marc developed, she has little taste for violence.&nbsp;Though this has led to dissociative behaviors, depression, and a flat affect in her personal life, in the field Marc is as present and capable as a leader as ever.&nbsp;While driven by a strong sense of duty she developed back home, after being called up to serve in the DoJ/HR Marc has finally found a sense of pride in her work to help ease her sleep, if ever so slightly.</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\tHer fighting style is direct and without pomp.&nbsp;It is not clean.</span></p>","quirks":[],"current_hp":10,"background":"Soldier","resistances":[],"portrait":"/pilots/TW63_Crop-nobg.png","cloud_portrait":"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/311986190297464832/1575627218703351858/TW63_Crop.jpg?ex=6b09f8b2&is=6b08a732&hm=a7f80ec7838069c54bf2349ace395f2619a1b78a34d922ba83cb8d673773096b","group":"","sort_index":3,"cc_ver":"","isDeleted":false,"expireTime":"","deleteTime":"","lastModified":"Fri Nov 27 2026 02:05:00 GMT-0800 (Pacific Standard Time)","lastUpdate_cloud":"Fri Nov 27 2026 02:05:00 GMT-0800 (Pacific Standard Time)","lastSync":"Fri Nov 27 2026 02:05:00 GMT-0800 (Pacific Standard Time)","skills":[{"id":"sk_assault","rank":2},{"id":"sk_get_somewhere_quickly","rank":2}